{"id":"fb492e1d42d41f7a","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-zero-one.md","title":"无常量纯关系词汇的一阶零一律","display":"thm-zero-one — 无常量纯关系词汇的一阶零一律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-zero-one","aliases":["29-thm-zero-one"],"display":"thm-zero-one — 无常量纯关系词汇的一阶零一律","depends_on":["[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 6.40; Corollary 6.41, pp.108–109, DjVu scans 123–124","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-zero-one"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-zero-one</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-zero-one — 无常量纯关系词汇的一阶零一律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e0b02880da0dad2\" href=\"?note=7e0b02880da0dad2\" title=\"29-df-asymptotic-prob\">29-df-asymptotic-prob</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c\" href=\"?note=f2b15fc22e8e3f0c\" title=\"29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one\">29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 6.40; Corollary 6.41, pp.108–109, DjVu scans 123–124"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\\geq1\">\\(a_i\\geq1\\)</span>；没有常量、函数或内建数值关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)\">\\(\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7e0b02880da0dad2\" href=\"?note=7e0b02880da0dad2\" title=\"29-df-asymptotic-prob\">29-df-asymptotic-prob</a> 中域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span> 的全部标号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 结构上的均匀概率，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>。每个关系表条目独立且概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>任一被视为输入的二元符号也按全部二元关系取样；不把它限制为线性序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\quad\\exists b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\quad\\exists b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 6.40 与 Corollary 6.41，印刷页 108–109、扫描页 123–124；概率与扩张公理见 pp.107–108、扫描页 122–123。已核对陈述与所给证明：每个 FO 句子仅含有限多个变量，故应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c\" href=\"?note=f2b15fc22e8e3f0c\" title=\"29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one\">29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one</a> 到其单元素句子集。原先仅以“关系词汇”排除函数，却仍允许常量；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle P^{(1)},c\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle P^{(1)},c\\rangle\\)</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\tau,n}(P(c))=1/2\">\\(\\mu_{\\tau,n}(P(c))=1/2\\)</span>，因此常量排除不可省略。本条同时断言极限存在，未把收敛预先作为假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-asymptotic-prob","status":"resolved","id":"7e0b02880da0dad2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one","status":"resolved","id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-sentence]]；$\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)$ 是 [[29-df-asymptotic-prob]] 中域为 $\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ 的全部标号 $\\tau$ 结构上的均匀概率，$n\\geq1$。每个关系表条目独立且概率为 $1/2$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-asymptotic-prob","status":"resolved","id":"7e0b02880da0dad2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-sentence]]；$\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)$ 是 [[29-df-asymptotic-prob]] 中域为 $\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ 的全部标号 $\\tau$ 结构上的均匀概率，$n\\geq1$。每个关系表条目独立且概率为 $1/2$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one","status":"resolved","id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Theorem 6.40 与 Corollary 6.41，印刷页 108–109、扫描页 123–124；概率与扩张公理见 pp.107–108、扫描页 122–123。已核对陈述与所给证明：每个 FO 句子仅含有限多个变量，故应用 [[29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]] 到其单元素句子集。原先仅以“关系词汇”排除函数，却仍允许常量；在 $\\tau=\\langle P^{(1)},c\\rangle$ 上 $\\mu_{\\tau,n}(P(c))=1/2$，因此常量排除不可省略。本条同时断言极限存在，未把收敛预先作为假设。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a_i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\quad\\exists b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)=b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle P^{(1)},c\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\tau,n}(P(c))=1/2","display":false}],"bytes":1766,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-zero-one]] — 一阶零一律"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-zero-one]]"}],"outgoing":["7e0b02880da0dad2","28e86a5f0243a0ae","711217f22972ffc0","f2b15fc22e8e3f0c"]}